      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you get first pick you can ban Omnitron and take Dawn. &nbsp;Which should cause Operative to start getting used.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If Ra wasn't so squishy, he could be just as effective. Might need Legacy support thought to be viable in a tourny setting.</p>",
