    {
      "id": 126096,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-08T17:41:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Dawn Ra is awesome, especially if you can grap Omnitron or Operative with the third. &nbsp;You use Ra like you use Ambuscade's Traps, but with the pillar, Solar flare and Dawn's buff with citizen Truth protecting Ra give you some great damage.</p><p>I've used Unity too, but you need better protection than Stealth Bot.</p><p>If you can grab Omnitron with your first pick, then Unity Ra would be amazing for your others. &nbsp;Keep Ra in the trees, and keep him next to Champion Bot and Turret Bot. &nbsp;Then have Omnitron run enemies through the gambit of Turret Bott at 5D and Ra's Tornado or Living Pyre at even more.</p><p>Still are vulnerable to origin attacks, but you can throw down some crazy damage.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:00:26.464Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
