      "raw": "<p>Dawn Ra is awesome, especially if you can grap Omnitron or Operative with the third. &nbsp;You use Ra like you use Ambuscade&#39;s Traps, but with the pillar, Solar flare and Dawn&#39;s buff with citizen Truth protecting Ra give you some great damage.</p><p>I&#39;ve used Unity too, but you need better protection than Stealth Bot.</p><p>If you can grab Omnitron with your first pick, then Unity Ra would be amazing for your others. &nbsp;Keep Ra in the trees, and keep him next to Champion Bot and Turret Bot. &nbsp;Then have Omnitron run enemies through the gambit of Turret Bott at 5D and Ra&#39;s Tornado or Living Pyre at even more.</p><p>Still are vulnerable to origin attacks, but you can throw down some crazy damage.</p>",
