      "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nDawn Ra is awesome, especially if you can grap Omnitron or Operative with the third. &nbsp;You use Ra like you use Ambuscade&#39;s Traps, but with the pillar, Solar flare and Dawn&#39;s buff with citizen Truth protecting Ra give you some great damage.I&#39;ve used Unity too, but you need better protection than Stealth Bot.If you can grab Omnitron with your first pick, then Unity Ra would be amazing for your others. &nbsp;Keep Ra in the trees, and keep him next to Champion Bot and Turret Bot. &nbsp;Then have Omnitron run enemies through the gambit of Turret Bott at 5D and Ra&#39;s Tornado or Living Pyre at even more.Still are vulnerable to origin attacks, but you can throw down some crazy damage.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou made me think of something interesting. Character Bans will have an impact on the teams chosen, but the environment can have a big impact too. I&#39;d hazard to guess that a map comprised mostly of Insula Primalis would see more Bunker play where as a map that was more city might see some Tachyon impact. Tachyon doesn&#39;t fair well in wide open spaces and Bunker hates moving through buildings. I&#39;d be interested to see some map shake ups in the next tourney\n",
